LOCATION:Stouppaioi / Tsakaioi\, Evia (South)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Two of the stone hamlets on the slopes above Karystos\, Stouppaioi and Tsakaioi\, hold their Panagia panigiria on 15 August in the schoolyards\, with violin-and-lute circle dances until dawn and home-cooked local dishes. Narrow roads and no lighting\, so drive up in daylight or share a taxi from Karystos.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/evia-south/#stouppaioi-tsakaioi-dekapentavgoustos-panigiria-stouppaioi-a
